  "_approach": "Tribal conga-cascade build into the drop: high/low conga call-and-response thickens bar by bar while the tresillo cowbell accelerates from a sparse pulse to a dense 16th cluster, the floor holding 4x4 in bar 1, breaking tresillo-style in bar 2, thinning to a single pickup in bar 3, and dropping out entirely in bar 4 so a crash plus a conga/tom peak can land on the very last 16th before the drop. Ref: the DJ Gregory/Karizma tribal-house lineage behind ukfunky_tribal_conga_01, Attack Magazine's tribal-percussion techniques in \"Big House\". (re-voiced for the Vermona DRM1 MKIII's 8 channels)",
